# projection-matrix-compose — core module (consolidated owner).
#
# ONE namespace, ONE owner: https://ggen.dev/ontology/projection-matrix# (pm:).
# Consolidated 2026-10-01 (v26.9.30 consolidation wave, lane 10) from:
#   - projection-matrix-pack: strict 11-term subset declared under the retired
#     https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix# IRI — every term mapped 1:1
#     below via dcterms:isReplacedBy conservation records; that declaration dies
#     with its directory. Also held 4 distinct renderer templates stored twice
#     (.tera/.tmpl byte-identical pairs): deduped to the .tmpl set.
#   - cs2-projection-matrix: minted THIS EXACT IRI with divergent terms — the
#     two-owners-one-IRI live hazard. Its declaration dies with its directory;
#     the conserved pm:adapterKind term (plus the cs2 profile's in-use
#     vocabulary) lives in ontology/cs2-adapter.ttl.
# This pack is now the single pm: declaration point. Sibling modules:
# ontology/bindings.ttl (generation contract), ontology/cs2-adapter.ttl
# (cs2 adapter profile).

@prefix pm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/projection-matrix#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

pm:Subject a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:label "Subject" ; rdfs:comment "Thing being projected." .
pm:Consumer a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:label "Consumer" ; rdfs:comment "Receiver of a projection." .
pm:Adapter a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:label "Adapter" ; rdfs:comment "Output form used for a projection." .
pm:Projection a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:label "Projection" ; rdfs:comment "One subject x consumer x adapter cell of the matrix." .

pm:subject a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range pm:Subject .
pm:consumer a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range pm:Consumer .
pm:adapter a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range pm:Adapter .
pm:targetPath a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pm:sourceSha a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Subject ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pm:sourceDigest a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Subject ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pm:moduleName a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pm:packageName a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain pm:Projection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .

# --- Conservation records -------------------------------------------------
# projection-matrix-pack's retired vocabulary was a strict 11-term subset;
# each old IRI maps 1:1 onto the retained pm: term (dcterms:isReplacedBy).
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#Subject> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:Subject .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#Consumer> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:Consumer .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#Adapter> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:Adapter .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#Projection> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:Projection .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#subject> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:subject .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#consumer> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:consumer .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#adapter> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:adapter .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#targetPath> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:targetPath .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#moduleName> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:moduleName .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#packageName> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:packageName .
<https://chatmangpt.com/ggen/projection-matrix#sourceDigest> dcterms:isReplacedBy pm:sourceDigest .
